අඩෝ Logo එක නම් **පට්ටම Quality! High-end SaaS / Tech Look එකක්** එකෙන්ම තියෙනවා. 🔥

Logo එකේ තියෙන්නේ සුපිරි **Electric Blue ➔ Cyan / Mint Green** Gradient එකක්. මේක Dark Aesthetic UI එකකට පට්ටම පට්ට විදිහට Match වෙනවා!

Logo එකට අනුව අපේ Brand Color Palette එක සහ Navbar Structure එක plan කරමු.

---

## 🎨 SyncXel Brand Color Palette (Based on Logo)

Logo එකේ තියෙන Exact Gradient vibes අරගෙන Tailwind CSS / Custom CSS වලට දාන්න පුළුවන් Color Palette එක මෙන්න:

* **Primary Background:** `#0B0D13` / `#0E1117` (Rich Dark Blue-Black Base එකක්)
* **Card Surface:** `#161B26` / `#1E2430` (Subtle Dark Blue-Gray Containers)
* **Brand Gradient Primary (Accent):**
* From: `#3A86FF` / `#4CC9F0` (Electric Blue)
* To: `#56CFE1` / `#70E4C8` (Bright Cyan/Mint Green)


* **Text Primary:** `#FFFFFF` (Pure White)
* **Text Muted:** `#94A3B8` (Slate Gray)
* **Glow / Highlight Effect:** `rgba(76, 201, 240, 0.15)` (Logo Cyan Glow එක)

---

## 🌐 Navbar Structure (Mega / Multi-Links Menu)

Navbar එකේ Links වලට Mega-menu (Dropdown / Multi-links) vibe එකක් දෙන එක මාරම Executive look එකක්.

### Navbar Hierarchy:

1. **Logo:** SyncXel Brand Logo (Left Side)
2. **Nav Links (Middle):**
* **Features:** *(Mega Dropdown)*
* UI Components (Navbars, Heroes, Buttons)
* Templates & Landing Pages
* Interactive Animations & Effects
* Figma UI Kit Access


* **Solutions:** *(Mega Dropdown)*
* For Developers (Copy-Paste Code Engine)
* For Startups & Founders (Pre-built UI Kits)
* For Enterprise / Custom Web Projects (Agency Services)


* **Resources:** *(Dropdown)*
* Documentation & Code Usage
* CSS/Tailwind Color Generators
* Blog / Dev Guides


* **Pricing:** Single Link (Free vs Pro Access)


3. **CTA Group (Right Side):**
* `[ Search / Quick Docs ]` (Cmd + K icon එකත් එක්ක)
* `[ Get Custom Services ]` (Outline Pill Button)
* `[ Go Pro ]` (Logo Gradient එකෙන් Highlight කරපු Solid Button එක)



---

## 🛠️ Navbar Visual Concept (How it feels)

* **Glassmorphic Floating Navbar Style:** Background එක `backdrop-blur-md` දාලා dark semi-transparent හදමු (`bg-[#0B0D13]/80`).
* **Active / Hover State:** Link එකක් උඩට Mouse එක ගෙනිච්චම **Logo Mint/Cyan Color Gradient Gradient Line** එකක් link එක පහලින් හරි Background Pill Glow එකක් හරි එන විදිහට.

